---
---
<section class="why">
  <div class="why-inner">
    <p class="sec-eye" style="color:var(--yellow);">Why us</p>
    <div class="why-grid">
      <div class="why-item"><strong>Queer and trans led</strong><span>Hosted by Santi Solis, founder of Queerness Experiences.</span></div>
      <div class="why-item"><strong>Tulum local</strong><span>Born in Mexico, living in Tulum since 2017.</span></div>
      <div class="why-item"><strong>Friends, not vendors</strong><span>Small businesses run by friends of ours.</span></div>
      <div class="why-item"><strong>Personalized</strong><span>Built around your group's interests.</span></div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .why{background:var(--blue);padding:var(--s-md) var(--s-sm);}
  .why-inner{max-width:1120px;margin:0 auto;}
  .why-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:12px;margin-top:var(--s-sm);}
  .why-item{border:2px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.5);padding:18px 16px;color:var(--white);display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:6px;}
  .why-item strong{font-family:var(--ff);font-size:15px;line-height:1.2;text-transform:uppercase;font-weight:400;}
  .why-item span{font-size:14px;line-height:1.5;color:rgba(255,255,255,0.85);}
  @media(min-width:720px){
    .why{padding:var(--s-md) 40px;}
    .why-grid{grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr);gap:16px;}
    .why-item strong{font-size:17px;}
  }
</style>
